{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7cbf39be8f41e3c59f55dbeafecb1760edb25f028ebf7ac8da28eda68d786f56", "ja": "（可憐が、香水ブランドとコラボ香水を作った。今日は\nプロデュースした服のPRも兼ねた、CM撮影日……）", "zh": "（可怜和香水品牌合作制作了联名香水。今天是兼顾宣传她制作的服装的广告拍摄日……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "f74f96bc1d16160c20a6a5cc75630e6d707363b1774eb26af93576119c48a61c", "ja": "……あれ？　{$P$}さんから、\nなんだか、いい香りが……あの、この香りって……。", "zh": "……咦？从{$P$}先生那边，好像飘来了很好闻的香味……那个，这股香味是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1002_p", "source_sha256": "807067c808a8745be875bb7f280e8383aa2bc31c30dd5c822dee8b9520aa0c0f", "ja": "嗅いだだけでわかるなんて、流石だな。\n今回のコラボ香水を、試しにつけてきたんだ。", "zh": "光闻一下就能发现，真不愧是你。\n我试着喷了一下这次联名的香水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "c819d1f51861ece08fd52faba961df1efbff2d4c0dc9b349f0e7cbdb91c8d057", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですね……。\n私がつけたときとは、ちょっと違いますけど……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……。\n和我戴上的时候，感觉有点不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "a5d03681daae71f2bb0749cefeb0242a5eaedc51103277ba0866931a0829e76e", "ja": "スー、ハー……。{$P$}さんの\n香りと混ざって……うん……心が落ち着きます……。", "zh": "吸——呼……和{$P$}先生的香气混在一起……嗯……心情平静下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1d8d3e687df7d9d5593cb073c1ebedb22378a675cd03a755bbc4cf316cf0de6d", "ja": "ははは、そ、そうか……。\nそ、それより可憐？　ちょっと近い気が……。", "zh": "哈哈哈，是、是吗……。 \n不、不说这个了，可怜？是不是有点太近了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "3dbba5473bb33fc7f07dca609eb14cd0db31db6af808bf2b9fa26b8d9ce05686", "ja": "……はっ！　す、すみません……！\n全然気づかなくて……うぅ、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "……啊！对、对不起……！\n我完全没注意到……呜呜，好丢人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0697020c9a2fcbedc734da1dd0d9cc33b088024a10af56072d3e2a38a5a4b489", "ja": "いや、いいと思うよ。可憐が夢中になるぐらい\n好みの香りができたってことだからな。", "zh": "没事的，我觉得挺好啊。说明调配出了\n能让可怜沉浸其中的心仪香味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "b682f2b0ed3e30f5c47c0b832c665d3ba07cb762907b28b5e40a628d0bc0cb1f", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。たくさん迷って、\n時間もかかっちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……我犹豫了好久，也花了不少时间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "a860fe33a2d3fcf9d2ecab5216fc5284da8f02a7982ffbd993916be1da78bc1b", "ja": "最後は、自分の直感を信じてみました……。だから、\nですかね……？　ちょっと特別に感じちゃって……。", "zh": "最后，我试着相信了自己的直觉……。所以，\n才会这样吧……？　感觉有点特别……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2cc4ee653064663df33e02b621ad5dbcb0573cc217811f063a97ff6d579eb011", "ja": "その服と同じで、可憐が思いを込めて考えたんだ。\nやっぱり自分の手で携わったものは、感慨深いよな。", "zh": "就像那件衣服一样，是可怜倾注心意构思出来的。果然，亲手参与制作的东西，还是让人感慨万千啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c31f20eb30d2847cfd9fa4d9ed5d7fb75fa821238079cdb307658dbf0eb67673", "ja": "まあ、服は着られないけど……可憐のコラボ香水が\n発売されたら、買って使わなきゃな！", "zh": "虽然衣服我是穿不上了……不过要是可怜的联名香水\n发售了，我一定要买来用用看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "d105c88ab7049c64cfe544d7636693017c0fbf821ab4217862efe7824e8ef445", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？　私の選んだ香りを、\n{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？我选的香味，{$P$}先生竟然会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "f1676536554dcfda2166cfa8ba6a329f157cffbf71f93551a06b308857d57ea7", "ja": "わあ～……！　す、すごく、うれしいです……。\n頑張って調香して、よかったぁ……。えへへ……♪", "zh": "哇～……！真、真的非常开心……。\n努力调香果然是值得的……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "6a0fd2c57aabf3606e6f798258dda1c3641446494f2672ebbc8dc38a90d62054", "ja": "その、私も気に入ってて……。アンバサダーですし……\nこれからも、いっぱい使おうって思ってて……あっ。", "zh": "那个，我自己也很喜欢……毕竟是大使嘛……\n我还想着以后要多用用……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "f54eac877e8e14b82fdea4783a20decbecc1326736bea96edd1f3a33781bcf64", "ja": "{$P$}さんも使うってことは……\nわ、私と同じ香りに……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生也会用的话，岂不是……\n会、会变成和我一样的香气……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "a29661a6cd0006894ae52ffaac2d752584a8104d30342a42503755b3836c2e3f", "ja": "い、いえ……！　なんでもないです……本当に……！\n宣伝にもなりますし……たくさん、つけますね……。", "zh": "没、没什么……！真的……没什么……！\n而且也能做宣传……我会多戴一些的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0584_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "9d5896f5bca793dff35462fd4516fd1f803eaa6937ef396b94de00f8a1dde3e0", "ja": "だから{$P$}さんも、ご迷惑じゃ\nなかったら……また、つけて欲しいです。……なんて。", "zh": "所以如果给{$P$}先生也不会添麻烦的话……我也想让您再次戴上。……我在说什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
